          "settings": {
            "kicker": "CoCo & Co",
            "heading": "Coconuts make people happy.",
            "body": "<p>Those street parties grew into CoCo &amp; Co, making custom coconuts for brands and events. The mission was simple then and it still is now: <strong>spread joy with coconuts.</strong></p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/sunboy-ian-cooler.jpg",
            "bg": "#0BB89B",
            "fg": "#FFFFFF"
          }
        },
        "c3": {
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "kicker": "Hydration libations",
            "heading": "The best mixer was hiding in plain sight.",
            "body": "<p>A decade of coconut cocktails taught us that coconut water is the ultimate mixer: naturally hydrating, low in sugar and calories, and kinder to the morning after.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/sunboy-ian-cheers.jpg",
            "bg": "#F9ED25",
            "fg": "#523B18"
          }
        },
        "c4": {
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "kicker": "Here comes the sun",
            "heading": "So we put it in a can.",
            "body": "<p>SUNBOY is real coconut water and real fruit, playfully spiked and sparkled. 5% ABV, zero added sugar, made for parks, beaches, rooftops and every golden hour in between. You'll thank us tomorrow morning.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/sunboy-ian-night.jpg",
            "bg": "#F79359",
            "fg": "#523B18"
          }
        }
